---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Happy Green World Foundation was founded in 2013 by environmental consultant Marlou Jongejan-Bessem. Learn about our team, our mission, and the philosophy behind our work."
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section style="
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D6A4F 0%, #1e4d38 100%);
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    color: #fff;
  ">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <a href="/" style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65); text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
        <span style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); margin: 0 0.5rem;">/</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);">About Us</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 1rem;">
        Who we are
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">
        A small, dedicated team with a shared belief — that the habits children develop early determine the kind of world they grow into.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission section -->
  <section style="padding: 5rem 1.5rem; background: var(--color-bg);">
    <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: center;" class="mission-grid">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 1.25rem;">
          Our mission
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 1.25rem;">
          Happy Green World Foundation develops environmental education programmes for children aged 6–16 around the world. Our curriculum focuses on three core themes — <strong style="color: var(--color-text);">waste, water, and energy</strong> — and is adapted for each community we work in.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0;">
          We create activity guides, student books, games, and coloring sheets with culturally relevant illustrations, then partner with local NGOs, schools, and organisations to deliver them to children who need them most.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="position: relative; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 4/3;">
        <img
          src="/images/about-girl-waste-game.png"
          alt="A child engaging with Happy Green World's waste sorting educational game"
          style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div style="
          position: absolute;
          bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
          padding: 1.5rem;
          background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(26,46,26,0.85) 0%, transparent 100%);
        ">
          <p style="
            font-family: var(--font-display);
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #fff;
            line-height: 1.45;
            margin: 0;
          ">
            "We do not inherit the earth from our ancestors — we borrow it from our children."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who / What / Why / How -->
  <section style="padding: 5rem 1.5rem; background: var(--color-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 2.5rem; text-align: center;">
        Who we are, what we do, and why it matters
      </h2>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem;" class="mission-cards-grid">

        <!-- WHO -->
        <div style="
          border-radius: 14px;
          padding: 2rem;
          background: rgba(82, 183, 136, 0.08);
          border: 1px solid rgba(82, 183, 136, 0.25);
        ">
          <div style="
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 40px; height: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #52B788;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
          " aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Who</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">
            The Happy Green World Foundation develops educational programs regarding waste, water and energy with the aim to encourage sustainable behaviour in children aged 4 to 16 years old.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- WHAT -->
        <div style="
          border-radius: 14px;
          padding: 2rem;
          background: rgba(116, 192, 252, 0.1);
          border: 1px solid rgba(116, 192, 252, 0.3);
        ">
          <div style="
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 40px; height: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #74C0FC;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
          " aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 21V9"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">What</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">
            Our quality educational programs consist of practical and playful activity guides, student books and games. The educational materials are custom made regarding illustrations, translation and content — adapting to the partner's country, culture, language and customs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- WHY -->
        <div style="
          border-radius: 14px;
          padding: 2rem;
          background: rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.08);
          border: 1px solid rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.25);
        ">
          <div style="
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 40px; height: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #F4A261;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
          " aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v4M12 16h.01"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">Why</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">
            Our goal is to offer environmental education in the curriculum of countries all over the world. Children who learn sustainable behaviour at a young age will become adults who actively contribute to a cleaner and healthier living environment — a Happy Green World!
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- HOW -->
        <div style="
          border-radius: 14px;
          padding: 2rem;
          background: rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.1);
          border: 1px solid rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.35);
        ">
          <div style="
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 40px; height: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: #FFD166;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
          " aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5a4200" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 0.75rem;">How</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0;">
            Partner with us and teach environmental education in your local community. We guide you through every step of a successful project. Partners are encouraged to find a local sponsor to fund development and printing — and their logos can be displayed on the educational materials.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founding story section -->
  <section style="padding: 4rem 1.5rem; background: var(--color-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem); color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 2rem;">
        How it started
      </h2>
      <div style="position: relative; padding-left: 2rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--color-border);">
        {[
          {
            year: '2009',
            event: 'Marlou Jongejan-Bessem, then an environmental consultant, begins working in Cairo — and witnesses firsthand the devastating impact of poor waste management on communities and children.',
          },
          {
            year: '2013',
            event: 'Happy Green World Foundation (Stichting Happy Green World) is formally established in the Netherlands. The first educational materials are created for Egypt.',
          },
          {
            year: '2014–2019',
            event: 'The partnership model expands to Indonesia, Senegal, Ethiopia, and beyond. Materials are localised for each new country with culturally specific illustrations and examples.',
          },
          {
            year: 'Today',
            event: 'Happy Green World works with 42 partner organisations in 26 countries across 4 continents, continuing to develop new programmes and deepen existing partnerships — always guided by the belief that lasting environmental change begins in the classroom.',
          },
        ].map(({ year, event }) => (
          <div style="position: relative; margin-bottom: 2rem; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
            <div style="
              position: absolute;
              left: -2.625rem;
              top: 0.375rem;
              width: 14px;
              height: 14px;
              border-radius: 50%;
              background: var(--color-primary);
              border: 3px solid var(--color-bg);
            " aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.8125rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-primary); letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.375rem;">
              {year}
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">
              {event}
            </p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Photo gallery strip -->
  <section style="padding: 2rem 0; background: var(--color-bg); overflow: hidden;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0 1.5rem; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none;" class="photo-strip">
      {[
        { src: '/images/booklet-philippines-children.png', alt: 'Children with Happy Green World books in the Philippines' },
        { src: '/images/booklet-botswana-classroom.png', alt: 'Classroom in Botswana holding up Happy Green World student books' },
        { src: '/images/booklet-children-outdoor.png', alt: 'Children reading Happy Green World materials outdoors' },
        { src: '/images/about-indonesia-reading.jpg', alt: 'Students reading Happy Green World materials in Indonesia' },
        { src: '/images/about-cameroon.jpg', alt: 'Happy Green World programme activities in Cameroon' },
        { src: '/images/country-thailand-programme.jpg', alt: 'Happy Green World programme in Thailand' },
        { src: '/images/about-australia.jpg', alt: 'Happy Green World activities in Australia' },
      ].map(({ src, alt }) => (
        <div style="
          flex-shrink: 0;
          width: 280px;
          height: 200px;
          border-radius: 14px;
          overflow: hidden;
          background: var(--color-border);
        ">
          <img src={src} alt={alt} style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block;" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA section -->
  <section style="
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    text-align: center;
  ">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 1.875rem); color: var(--color-text); margin: 0 0 0.875rem;">
        Want to work with us?
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 2rem;">
        If you represent a school, NGO, foundation, or corporate programme and want to bring Happy Green World to your community, we'd love to hear from you.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.875rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a
          href="/partner-with-us"
          style="
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
            background: var(--color-primary);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
          "
        >
          Partner With Us
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          style="
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0.875rem 1.75rem;
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--color-primary);
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
          "
        >
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mission-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: 2rem !important; }
    .mission-cards-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
  }
</style>
